 write_text(ROOT/"MINIMAL_OBSERVER_SEARCH.md",intro+"`M_OCCUPANCY` failed broadly. `M_EVENT_CAUSAL` remains minimal in the event sector. `M_HISTORY` and `M_MATTER_REL` add information only where future response or organized interfaces require it. Backward ablation and fresh canaries selected `S_CAUSAL_PANEL_V1`; Q0 is sufficient but needlessly expensive.\n")
