 write_text(ROOT/"HUMAN_EFFECTIVE_SHADOW_CANDIDATE.md",intro+"A human-scale physical analogy would see position/motion from route+direction, material response from organization topology, detector records from event+history, and dissipative change from ensemble direction statistics. Mass, weight, temperature, brightness and pressure are not identified because the required cross-system response laws are absent.\n")
