 write_text(ROOT/"NEGATIVE_RESULTS.md",intro+"No common scalar shadow; no mobile persistent-object inertia law; no field/weight relation; no Theta or zeroth law; no friction pair; no sound/continuum closure; no autonomous distributed wave; no quantum-specific mechanism; no shared external map. Every null is scoped by its mechanism and prerequisite.\n")
